+ * |   128  |      checksum      |                    |  |  |  |  |
+ * +--------+--------------------+--------------------+  |  |  |  |
+ * |   136  |  num_root_complex  |                    |  |  |  |  |
+ * +--------+--------------------+                    |  |  |  |  |
+ * |   144  |   rc_info_version  |                    |  |  |  |  |
