+ * |   160  |      checksum      |                    |  |  |  |  |  |
+ * +--------+--------------------+--------------------+<-+  |  |  |  |
+ * |   168  |       base 0       |                    |     |  |  |  |
+ * +--------+--------------------+     mem_bank[0]    |     |  |  |  |
+ * |   176  |       size 0       |                    |     |  |  |  |
+ * +--------+--------------------+--------------------+<----+  |  |  |
+ * |   184  |       base         |                    |        |  |  |
+ * +--------+--------------------+                    |        |  |  |
+ * |   192  |      map_pages     |                    |        |  |  |
+ * +--------+--------------------+                    |        |  |  |
+ * |   200  |       name         |                    |        |  |  |
+ * +--------+--------------------+     consoles[0]    |        |  |  |
+ * |   208  |     clk_in_hz      |                    |        |  |  |
+ * +--------+--------------------+                    |        |  |  |
+ * |   216  |     baud_rate      |                    |        |  |  |
+ * +--------+--------------------+                    |        |  |  |
+ * |   224  |       flags        |                    |        |  |  |
+ * +--------+--------------------+--------------------+<-------+  |  |
+ * |   232  |       base 0       |                    |           |  |
+ * +--------+--------------------+    ncoh_region[0]  |           |  |
+ * |   240  |       size 0       |                    |           |  |
+ * +--------+--------------------+--------------------+           |  |
+ * |   248  |       base 1       |                    |           |  |
+ * +--------+--------------------+    ncoh_region[1]  |           |  |
+ * |   256  |       size 1       |                    |           |  |
+ * +--------+--------------------+--------------------+<----------+  |
+ * |   264  |     smmu_base      |                    |              |
+ * +--------+--------------------+      smmus[0]      |              |
+ * |   272  |     smmu_r_base    |                    |              |
+ * +--------+--------------------+--------------------+<-------------+
+ * |   280  |     ecam_base      |                    |
+ * +--------+--------------------+                    |
+ * |   288  |      segment       |                    |
+ * +--------+--------------------+                    |
+ * |   289  |      padding       |   root_complex[0]  +--+
